ough taking advantage of what  blockchain has to offer and the ways  that blockchain can improve traditional  payment paradigms so let's dig into the  benefits  and how it works Puma pay is basically a  blockchain based billing protocol that  doesn't have the weaknesses that we  often see in kryptos like bitcoin and  litecoin and it's accessible in both  online and offline markets Puma pays  full payment protocol uses a brand-new  smart contract architecture which is  essentially inversing the mechanics of a  crypto transaction instead of the  customer sending or pushing funds a  business is pulling funds from a  customer's wallet  based on terms that have been  pre-approved and this was what makes all  of the other features on the platform  possible the Puma paid token fuels at  all it's called the PMA this is the  mechanism of payment between businesses  and customers in Puma pays ecosystem and  the platform allows businesses to choose  all kinds of billing models it could be  single payments they could be scheduled  payments monthly subscriptions paper use  shared payments and Puma pays the first  platform with such flexible payment  options over the blockchain back in  October of 2018 they were the first ever  a company to introduce recurring  payments on the blockchain this is  actually a big deal and now they're  pushing the boundaries of what the  technology can do even further the  platform is able to adapt to almost any  kind of business logic transactions over  the Puma pay protocol are totally free  with the exception of a small gas fee  payable to the etherium blockchain but  there's no middleman all transactions  are made directly from business to  customer through the blockchain and  businesses don't have to wait days to  receive the funds because all  transactions are processed on the  blockchain in mere minutes a huge  benefit to using blockchain like this is  that all transactions are final and  immutable which means that the  chargeback risk is completely eliminated  there's no risk of crypto volatility  because puma pays fiat settlement layer  guarantees liquidity by locking the rate  of the PMA token at the moment the  transaction takes place and through this  fiat settlement layer businesses get  funds as fiat to their bank account  without many of the hassles and costs  that often have to be endured when one  is liquidating crypto into fiat currency  something we  dealt with in fact this is an annoyance  that as a business owner who accepts  crypto as payment I'm very very familiar  with now customers using the platform  have a wallet where they can approve  withdrawals from businesses  pre-authorized payments set withdrawal  limits and customers are actually able  to use crypto to buy things in their  everyday life because on the other end  Puma pay is providing businesses with  the tools that they need to accept the  crypto in the first place and what's in  it for the businesses is that they can  now tap into the billions and billions  of dollars worth of crypto worldwide  that businesses for the most part have  been missing out on there's over a  hundred brands that have actually  already committed to using the Puma pay  platform including some big names like  wix.com Puma pay makes the integration  painless with their business console  this is another reason that they're  bringing in a lot of early adopters and  the business console is also where the  business sets up they're building models  and manages every aspect of accepting  PMA tokens if you want to start using  business if you are a business that  wants to start using Puma pay better  said you merely have to go to the Puma  Pay website and register the know your  customer is compliant with all  regulations they've done a great job of  streamlining this process and just  making everything it's got to be easy  for businesses who want to do something  like this and Puma pay makes it really  easy to integrate Puma pay also makes it  really easy for crypto savvy businesses  and crypto savvy customers to find one  another their service called Puma pay  pride is a directory of businesses that  have adopted the Puma payment system and  it basically acts as a hub where  customers can find them and where Puma  pay integrated businesses can promote  their products and Puma pay pride will  soon be integrated into the Puma pay  mobile Wallet app with an interface that  makes it easy for customers to search  and browse and creates an efficient way  to use crypto as a means of payment  it'll let businesses expand their  customer base it'll allow customers to  spend crypto on e-commerce stores in  ways that they weren't previously able  and it'll do it all with a level of ease  that just didn't  this previously and it will allow  businesses to make use of a really  unique marketing tool that I'm not aware  of existing ever anywhere else where  businesses can create communicate and  promote offers directly to crypto hole  holders within the customers wallet so  let's talk about the wallet a little bit  more the whole point of the wallet is to  make everyday use of crypto as a means  of payment viable and efficient for  customers it's a native wallet designed  to fully immerse customers in the Puma  pay ecosystem it gives them an easy way  to buy products and services from  businesses that accept that p.m. a token  as a method of payment the wallet is  available for iOS and Android you can  store send receive and exchange PMA  tokens Bitcoin litecoin coin aetherium  any kind of ERC 20 token whether it's  Cardno  bitcoin cash ripple - stellar these are  crypt those that will be supported on  the wallet very soon and you can manage  every aspect of your subscription  payments to businesses that use Puma pay  as well as the other types of payments  that I mentioned payment sharing as an  example they even have a Chrome  extension that lets you pay businesses  straight from your browser using the  same private key that you use on your  wallet and on other devices so let's  talk about the project itself  Puma pay had a hugely successful private  sale last year they raised over a  hundred and seventeen million dollars  this was one of the bigger I SEOs of  2018 the project is led by CEO Joe of  drawer who holds an MBA and has over 20  years of experience heading up high  volume high transaction companies which  you would definitely want a leader of a  company like Puma pay to have I'll  actually be interviewing ya later this  month which I'm looking forward to now  there are a ton of problems that Puma  pay is solving here one is they're  providing a universal token through  which businesses and customers can  interact second they're having the  currency fed through a system that  allows businesses and customers to synch  seamlessly where it's easy to pay easy  to accept the funds plenty of  customization that can  in terms of the payments set up whether  it's monthly as I mentioned paper use  paper time whatever works for the  particular transaction type and  businesses can set it up however they  want and this is something we've not  seen with crypto and number three and  this is really the catalyst that I think  gives the project so much potential is  that they're making it affordable for  everybody involved fees are way down  compared to the alternatives and that  will be a massive factor in influencing  adoption if kryptos are ever going to go  mainstream you need a set of tools like  this that's easy to integrate and easy  to use and follows regulations both on  the business and the customer side and  you also need a set of tools that will  mitigate risk as far as volatility and  liquidity we've talked about this so  much the way Puma paid does it provides  a bridge between the crypto holder and  businesses who want to start  capitalizing on what is a huge and  largely still untapped crypto market out  there I'm really enjoying following Puma  pay it'll be exciting to see what comes